# Paid assets: never on GitHub (the repo is public). Keep the purchased packs here, outside git.
Universal Animation Library*/
/paid/
# The rifle mod's look (its scene, effects and its animation pack, made from licensed animations):
# local only. The server mod is in the repository; without the look a rifle is a plain box that
# is held in the character's own "rifle" stance.
server_mods/rifle/client/
server_mods/rifle/client_item.cfg
# The character built from the paid Source pack (its glb, scene, baked clips): local only.
godot/characters/ual_mannequin/

